which playing a game is the means. That's the meta-goal, outside the
game, and the only goal that ultimately matters.

Maybe "running around" doesn't contribute appreciably to the in-game
goal of ascension, but so what? If you spend 500K turns, never get below
Dlvl6, then die -- but have a good time in the process -- then you're not
doing anything wrong.

> Just don't tell me that this much prep is *necessary* to survive the
